  "prefLabel": "He-P 1901.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-11-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 1901.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to protect the health of the public by identifying the conditions and procedures for the enforcement of the New Hampshire Indoor Smoking Act, RSA 155:64-78.\n\nSource. #5759, eff 12-20-93; ss by #7172, eff 12-21-99, EXPIRED: 12-21-07\n\nNew. #9054, eff 12-29-07, EXPIRED: 12-29-15\n\nNew. #12534, INTERIM, eff 5-24-18, EXPIRES: 11-20-18; ss by #12677, eff 11-20-18",
